11
00:00:28.945 --> 00:00:30.363 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也不用打我吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.990 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
