16
00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:52.635 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来是警察局长的下属啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.015 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧
