18
00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:58.683 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:00.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
