21
00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:09.903 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很不好意思 我可以在这里等他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:10.403 --> 00:01:11.279 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:11.362 --> 00:01:14.574 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可能会晚点回来
要是你不介意的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:14.657 --> 00:01:15.492 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.369 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:29.088 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:10.00% 
