33
00:03:12.984 --> 00:03:16.404 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来我们要十分小心</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:16.905 --> 00:03:17.822 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:17.906 --> 00:03:21.284 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是最关键的剑心不在…</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.871 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑即使一个人也不需要我们担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:25.663 --> 00:03:29.083 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之现在我们不能出去到处找他</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:29.167 --> 00:03:33.671 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少局长派来的剑客警官在这</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:33.755 --> 00:03:35.215 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>道场比外面更安全</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:36.007 --> 00:03:37.300 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这倒也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:43.598 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>诶…</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:44.098 --> 00:03:47.435 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
