43
00:03:47.518 --> 00:03:49.229 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也有佩日本刀的啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:49.312 --> 00:03:52.148 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>军刀太脆弱 不够可靠</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:52.232 --> 00:03:55.151 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我有佩日本刀的特别许可</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:03:56.027 --> 00:03:59.697 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀果然还是日本刀最好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:03.368 --> 00:04:04.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>死了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:09.582 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然能挨上六下</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:13.294 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我答应你在墓前说出真相</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:13.378 --> 00:04:19.259 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤和我跟刃卫一样
