51
00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:23.304 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我也不清楚他们杀你的原因</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:23.388 --> 00:04:25.640 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕因为黑笠事件</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:25.723 --> 00:04:28.518 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大人物知道了你的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:29.102 --> 00:04:31.521 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>害怕你说出幕末时他们做的坏事</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:31.604 --> 00:04:34.565 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>才让我们杀掉你吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:35.066 --> 00:04:36.359 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:37.235 --> 00:04:41.781 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤一和鹈堂刃卫都是暗杀者啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:47.912 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没记错的话
斋藤在新选组的肃清队士中</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:47.996 --> 00:04:53.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是最常挥剑进行暗杀的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:53.626 --> 00:04:57.380 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙挨了六下竟然还没事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:57.964 --> 00:05:02.593 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使到了这个时代
那个男人还在做这种蠢事啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:03.177 --> 00:05:06.389 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管还要多少次 我都要杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:09.809 --> 00:05:10.893 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
