64
00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:11.936 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的双手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:22.447 --> 00:05:23.448 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
