66
00:05:23.948 --> 00:05:25.867 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-薰小姐
-哎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.327 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.163 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的被人盯上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:31.205 --> 00:05:32.290 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:32.373 --> 00:05:33.875 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从哪里听说的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:35.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>从警察那里</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:38.463 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>局长先生的部下过来告诉我们的</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:39.672 --> 00:05:42.050 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>警视厅的警部补 剑客警官</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:42.133 --> 00:05:43.676 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>藤田五郎先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:46.888 --> 00:05:48.723 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:48.806 --> 00:05:52.310 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤末让你费了不少工夫啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:54.145 --> 00:05:56.939 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是变弱了很多</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:05:58.983 --> 00:06:04.030 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后一次对决还是在鸟羽伏见的战场</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:04.697 --> 00:06:06.616 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大约有十年没见了</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:08.493 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年？</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:08.576 --> 00:06:13.206 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 你现在改名叫藤田五郎了</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:13.956 --> 00:06:16.167 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
