83
00:06:16.834 --> 00:06:18.252 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:20.046 --> 00:06:21.798 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组？</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:22.757 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:25.426 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>盯上剑心的就是这家伙！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:26.761 --> 00:06:27.887 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:34.602 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有短短两个字
真正经历下来却是很漫长的一段岁月</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:34.685 --> 00:06:35.812 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:35.895 --> 00:06:38.815 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>漫长到足够让一个人腐化</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:42.276 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>以前的你</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:42.360 --> 00:06:45.446 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽管难以捉摸实力强大</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:50.618 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但总是堂堂正正进行决斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:51.744 --> 00:06:56.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤害对方的朋友让他动摇</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:56.207 --> 00:07:01.629 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>派遣走狗缠着对方又趁机威胁人质
这种肮脏手段你从来不会用</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:02.213 --> 00:07:07.468 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的你根本不是
在下认同的那个武士斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:18.062 --> 00:07:20.189 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋！有什么好笑的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:20.898 --> 00:07:22.984 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好笑啊 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:23.067 --> 00:07:25.153 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的很好笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:25.236 --> 00:07:27.405 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道你的剑术退步了</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:27.488 --> 00:07:30.199 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到脑子也变得这么迟钝</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:30.283 --> 00:07:31.159 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:31.242 --> 00:07:33.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤末是我的走狗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:34.787 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:35.371 --> 00:07:38.207 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会养一个那样的废物吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:43.546 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们新选组与刽子手拔刀斋交手最多</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:43.629 --> 00:07:46.466 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也最清楚你的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:47.049 --> 00:07:51.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但现在一个赤末都让你这么头疼</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:51.721 --> 00:07:56.642 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为不杀的浪客让你明显变弱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:58.978 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:07:59.562 --> 00:08:00.688 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>变弱了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:02.148 --> 00:08:05.401 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤 你怎么想无所谓</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:09.655 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的在下要保护身边的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:09.739 --> 00:08:12.366 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要有浪客的实力就足够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:18.289 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经不需要刽子手那样的强大力量了</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:20.541 --> 00:08:21.959 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:23.669 --> 00:08:26.172 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客的实力…</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:26.255 --> 00:08:27.381 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:27.465 --> 00:08:31.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么说的话
