120
00:08:35.139 --> 00:08:39.435 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当你中了我的圈套与赤末苦战的时候</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:40.102 --> 00:08:42.438 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一直都在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:43.105 --> 00:08:44.065 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:44.732 --> 00:08:48.528 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我想杀这些人 随时都能动手</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:50.321 --> 00:08:52.615 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅仅是这一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:58.871 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说着要保护身边的人
