128
00:09:13.302 --> 00:09:16.973 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道他从很久之前就监视着剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:17.974 --> 00:09:20.768 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种不可靠的力量等于没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:21.269 --> 00:09:25.815 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只会嘴上说说的伪善者只会让人不快</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:30.861 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！
