132
00:09:30.945 --> 00:09:34.323 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是今后可不一定这么顺利吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:37.493 --> 00:09:38.828 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:39.704 --> 00:09:46.002 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想着这么浅薄的道理
