00:10:15.948 --> 00:10:18.159 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>唯一共有的真正正义</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:19.619 --> 00:10:24.290 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的你简直让我无法容忍</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:25.541 --> 00:10:26.584 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
