147
00:10:36.177 --> 00:10:37.011 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:41.515 --> 00:10:42.475 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:43.643 --> 00:10:46.437 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要否定你的一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

