153
00:11:19.428 --> 00:11:20.888 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:20.971 --> 00:11:21.806 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:21.889 --> 00:11:25.267 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何 他已经盯上了在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

