<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…我总觉得…</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:35.152 --> 00:11:36.987 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我总有种预感…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:37.947 --> 00:11:41.575 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样下去剑心会消失不见…</c.simplifiedchinese>

