161
00:11:47.415 --> 00:11:49.625 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是你主动发起挑战的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:51.252 --> 00:11:52.086 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.296 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
