168
00:12:07.226 --> 00:12:09.478 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>打算这样避开吗 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:09.562 --> 00:12:11.021 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对空牙突？</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:12.273 --> 00:12:13.107 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
