174
00:12:29.039 --> 00:12:32.543 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>战术鬼才新选组副长土方岁三</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:32.626 --> 00:12:36.672 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>发明的这招“平刺突”根本没有死角</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:37.256 --> 00:12:40.134 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再加上我的牙突 更是所向披靡</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:42.553 --> 00:12:48.851 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>在实战中
