178
00:12:49.560 --> 00:12:53.772 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此只要有确保一击打倒敌人的技能</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:53.856 --> 00:12:56.775 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就不需要其他的技能</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:56.859 --> 00:13:00.321 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>坚持磨练自己的得意技能</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:00.404 --> 00:13:03.073 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到将它升华有绝对把握的必杀技</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:03.866 --> 00:13:06.285 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组真正的强大之处</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:06.368 --> 00:13:10.122 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
