190
00:13:41.737 --> 00:13:43.322 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让开 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:45.366 --> 00:13:46.742 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很碍事</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:53.332 --> 00:13:54.250 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:54.917 --> 00:13:56.168 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:59.338 --> 00:14:01.924 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于冲着刀来的第二击的反击</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:02.716 --> 00:14:06.637 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>必须比第一击还要更快</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:10.182 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的胸部受了相当重的伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:14:10.266 --> 00:14:11.475 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:14:12.434 --> 00:14:16.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他在这里停留的短短一段时间内</c.simplifiedchinese>

