00:14:16.939 --> 00:14:18.357 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>与许多敌人交过手</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.695 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一定学会了如何唤起
刽子手时的实力来获得胜利</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:23.904 --> 00:14:26.031 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然跟我预料的一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:26.615 --> 00:14:28.617 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>当他拿起剑时</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:34.248 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>都会不自觉地
逐渐回复到刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:36.876 --> 00:14:38.669 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比之前还快吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:39.503 --> 00:14:40.379 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>消失了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:41.171 --> 00:14:42.172 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下面？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:46.218 --> 00:14:47.761 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才那下怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:48.679 --> 00:14:52.224 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>远远超出我的预想</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:54.268 --> 00:14:56.353 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的呼吸非常急促…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:56.854 --> 00:15:01.692 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>发挥出了意料之外的力量
