<c.simplifiedchinese>因为跟我交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:15.873 --> 00:15:18.918 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年前的感觉显著复苏</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:19.418 --> 00:15:22.171 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>一下子变回了拔刀斋吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

