<c.simplifiedchinese>想要找出答案…</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:35.976 --> 00:15:37.686 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有用这招了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:40.606 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>真真正正的牙突</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:41.106 --> 00:15:42.399 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会再手下留情了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:43.317 --> 00:15:46.320 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？他刚才一直在手下留情？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:53.077 --> 00:15:53.911 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:53.994 --> 00:15:57.748 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他好像完全忘了
后面还有第二下横向攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:57.831 --> 00:16:00.334 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然只是单纯的战意激昂吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:10.469 --> 00:16:11.303 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:11.387 --> 00:16:15.307 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅避开了攻击
还利用离心力狠狠在背后一击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:15.891 --> 00:16:19.520 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算牙突再厉害
这么短的时间内见识了四次</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:19.603 --> 00:16:25.776 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再傻的人也能想出一两个破解招式吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:27.569 --> 00:16:28.779 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>站起来 斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:29.488 --> 00:16:34.535 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>时隔十年的决斗
就这样了结也太无趣了</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:39.707 --> 00:16:41.000 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:41.083 --> 00:16:42.751 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我改变想法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:43.711 --> 00:16:45.713 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要杀了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:45.796 --> 00:16:47.589 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>别做梦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:47.673 --> 00:16:51.218 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要杀了你的人应该是在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:16:57.057 --> 00:16:58.183 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:59.393 --> 00:17:00.561 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟那时一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:01.311 --> 00:17:04.481 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟刃卫交手那时完全一样…</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:05.065 --> 00:17:08.444 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>再这样下去 “剑心”就会消失了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:09.987 --> 00:17:11.280 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁能…</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:11.363 --> 00:17:12.406 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阻止他们…</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:14.908 --> 00:17:17.786 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁来阻止他们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:25.836 --> 00:17:28.547 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次就砍掉你的脑袋</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:28.630 --> 00:17:30.340 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害…</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:30.424 --> 00:17:33.385 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么感觉剑心
今天比平时更疯狂一些？</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:33.469 --> 00:17:34.511 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不！</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:34.595 --> 00:17:35.929 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>那不是剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:36.013 --> 00:17:37.556 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:37.639 --> 00:17:38.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:38.599 --> 00:17:40.142 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>必须阻止他们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:40.225 --> 00:17:42.269 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然的话 刽子手拔刀斋就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:42.352 --> 00:17:45.731 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们没法阻止他们的 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:47.691 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:47.775 --> 00:17:51.779 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们现在不是在明治时代的东京交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:51.862 --> 00:17:54.198 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是身处幕末的京都</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:54.782 --> 00:17:59.161 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>能阻止他们这场战斗的
只有同样经历过幕末动乱</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:04.124 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>体会过京都风云激荡的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:04.208 --> 00:18:08.670 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎么喊
他们都听不到我们的声音</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:14.009 --> 00:18:15.427 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>川路</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:15.511 --> 00:18:19.807 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤去神谷道场多久了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:21.892 --> 00:18:22.976 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大约…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:24.645 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>四个半小时</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:24.728 --> 00:18:25.979 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:26.939 --> 00:18:28.899 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望我们没来晚</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:29.399 --> 00:18:31.068 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>让马车再快点</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:31.151 --> 00:18:32.361 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:36.532 --> 00:18:41.036 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组的人还跟以前一样不懂退缩啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:43.831 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组队规第一条</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:43.914 --> 00:18:46.125 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>“绝不违反武士道”</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:46.208 --> 00:18:49.211 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>阵前逃亡有违武士道！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:49.294 --> 00:18:53.465 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起性命选择了新选组的荣誉啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:54.216 --> 00:18:55.717 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>也好</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:57.928 --> 00:18:59.012 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>空手？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:59.096 --> 00:19:00.806 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果用刀会产生破绽</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:00.889 --> 00:19:02.266 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负已分！</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:05.435 --> 00:19:07.896 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-腰带？
-他什么时候…</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.398 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:19:11.650 --> 00:19:13.152 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿剑！
-糟了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:19:13.235 --> 00:19:14.236 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:19:14.319 --> 00:19:15.696 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:19:16.738 --> 00:19:17.948 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想勒死剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:19:18.031 --> 00:19:20.409 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可没那么仁慈</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:20.492 --> 00:19:21.743 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:21.827 --> 00:19:24.204 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>要折断他的脖子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:26.665 --> 00:19:28.917 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的 别再做无用的挣扎了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:46.268 --> 00:19:47.644 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>这真是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:47.728 --> 00:19:49.646 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:52.399 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个人都没有余力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:52.482 --> 00:19:55.319 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一击就是最后一击了</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:55.903 --> 00:19:57.404 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是死是活</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:57.487 --> 00:19:59.281 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是同归于尽…</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:01.074 --> 00:20:03.577 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:04.077 --> 00:20:05.746 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:06.246 --> 00:20:07.581 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候做个了结了</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:08.165 --> 00:20:09.541 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:10.334 --> 00:20:11.460 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:12.127 --> 00:20:13.128 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:14.129 --> 00:20:15.255 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:18.342 --> 00:20:20.219 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要！</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:23.305 --> 00:20:25.140 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:25.766 --> 00:20:27.643 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>恢复理智吧 斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:27.726 --> 00:20:31.855 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的任务只是检验拔刀斋的能力</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:33.148 --> 00:20:35.067 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>我正在兴头上呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:35.150 --> 00:20:38.487 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使是你也不能插手</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:39.905 --> 00:20:45.577 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你身为新选组成员的骄傲
我已经十分了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:46.078 --> 00:20:46.912 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:47.496 --> 00:20:52.376 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:79.33% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是你的还是绯村的性命
都不能在这里白白浪费掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:54.127 --> 00:20:55.337 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:20:56.004 --> 00:20:59.299 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就是斋藤一身后的真正指使者</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:20:59.883 --> 00:21:02.469 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>前萨摩藩维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:21:02.552 --> 00:21:04.721 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治政府内务卿</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:21:04.805 --> 00:21:06.515 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保利通</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:22:45.072 --> 00:22:49.159 position:50.00%,middle align:middle size:80.00% line:84.67% 
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《明治11年5月14日》</c.simplifiedchinese>

